    "chunk_size_bytes": 436,
    "chunk_text": "Ravi says former President Wickremesinghe underwent surgery in Singapore\n\nOpposition MP Ravi Karunanayake yesterday told Parliament that former President Ranil Wickremesinghe had undergone a surgical procedure.\n\nMaking a statement during the debate on regulations under the Port City Commission Act, Karunanayake said the surgery had been completed successfully.\n\nWickremesinghe is reported to have undergone the procedure in Singapore."
