    "md5": "f1bc5b0a7d73085a05691e4fcb6e2b6c",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 710,
    "chunk_text": "UN maritime body urges \u2018safe maritime corridor\u2019 in Gulf\n\nThe UN\u2019s maritime body has called for a safe shipping \u201ccorridor\u201d in the Gulf to evacuate stranded vessels and seafarers following an emergency meeting that also condemned Iran for its attacks.\n\nFollowing two days of urgent talks in London convened because of the Middle East war, the International Maritime Organization said the \u201csafe maritime corridor\u201d should be established as \u201ca provisional and urgent measure\u201d.\n\nThe UN agency \u2013 responsible for regulating international shipping safety \u2013 added that the passageway must \u201cfacilitate the safe evacuation of merchant ships from the high-risk and affected areas to a safe place\u201d."
