    "chunk_size_bytes": 2000,
    "chunk_text": "Deloitte Tax Leader Charmaine Tillekeratne recognised as Highly Regarded Women in Tax Leader \u2013 Asia Pacific for 2026\n\nDeloitte Sri Lanka and Maldives Partner \u2013 Head of Tax Charmaine Tillekeratne\n\nDeloitte Sri Lanka\u00a0 recently announced that Deloitte Sri Lanka and Maldives Partner \u2013 Head of Tax Charmaine Tillekeratne has been recognised as \u2018Highly Regarded Women in Tax Leader \u2013 Asia Pacific for 2026\u2019 in the International Tax Review (ITR) World Tax Guide, a globally respected, independent publication profiling leading tax practitioners and firms.\n\nThe recognition highlights both individual leadership excellence and Deloitte Sri Lanka\u2019s continued strength in tax advisory services.\n\nThe ITR World Tax Guide evaluates tax professionals based on technical expertise, client feedback, and the ability to advise on complex and high impact matters across jurisdictions. Tillekeratne\u2019s inclusion reflects her contribution to the development of the tax profession and her role in advising organisations through evolving regulatory and compliance landscapes.\n\nTillekeratne leads Deloitte Sri Lanka\u2019s Tax practice, advising a broad portfolio of local and multinational clients on corporate tax, international tax, transfer pricing, and regulatory matters. Her work focuses on delivering practical, client-focused solutions while supporting organisations in managing risk, governance, and sustainable growth.\n\nDeloitte Sri Lanka and Maldives Country Managing Partner Channa Manoharan said: \u201cCharmaine\u2019s recognition is a reflection of the depth of expertise within our tax practice and our continued investment in developing leaders who can guide clients through complexity with confidence and integrity.\u201d\n\nTillekeratne said: \u201cA leader\u2019s strength is measured by the excellence of their team. This award is a testament to the dedication and collective achievements of our tax team. We remain steadfast in our commitment to professionalism and delivering quality at every step.\u201d"
  },
