    "md5": "fb2f01958626061ff93ec34e81313753",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1768,
    "chunk_text": "Home Lands delivers 3,500 resort apartments and villas\n\nThe Home Lands Group has reached a landmark milestone: the successful delivery of 3,500 residential units across its completed projects. This achievement reinforces the Group\u2019s position as the market leader, celebrated for its credibility, innovation, and commitment to creating lifestyle-focused developments.\n\nSince its inception, Home Lands has been at the forefront of modern living in Sri Lanka, pioneering resort-style, themed residential developments that seamlessly blend thoughtful design, ultimate comfort, and vibrant community living. Guided by a philosophy rooted in trust, integrity, and timely delivery, the Group has consistently elevated the homeownership experience, ensuring transparency, reliability, and exceptional service at every stage of the journey.\n\nHome Lands currently has over 6,000 residential units under management, of which 3,500 units have already been delivered and over 2,500 units under construction to be completed and delivered within the next 30 months across multiple themed resort lifestyle projects, which will be completed and delivered in 2026, 2027, and 2028. The company continues to expand its footprint while maintaining its commitment to timely delivery and unmatched quality.\n\nA cornerstone of Home Lands\u2019 success is its fully integrated business model. The Group operates as a conglomerate of 14 companies, including Heyraa Construction, which holds the prestigious CS2 grading from the Construction Industry Development Authority (CIDA) of Sri Lanka, a distinction reserved for a select few construction companies nationally. This integration provides customers with both developer and contractor assurance, ensuring confidence and long-term reliability."
  },
