    "language": "en",
    "md5": "71bf24e7211fc2f80764cf938b77ca31",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 460,
    "chunk_text": "UN Chief calls on US and Israel to end war, Iran to stop attacks\n\nUN Secretary-General Ant\u00f3nio\u00a0 Guterres has called on the US and Israel to end their war on Iran while urging Tehran to stop its attacks on neighbouring nations.\n\n\u201cIt is high time to end this war that is risking to get completely out of control,\u201d Guterres told reporters in Brussels after a meeting with EU leaders.\n\nHe also called for the reopening of the \u200cStrait of Hormuz to shipping."
