    "description": "Hegseth says no \u2018timeframe\u2019 for war on Iran as Pentagon asks for $ 200 b",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Hegseth-says-no-timeframe-for-war-on-Iran-as-Pentagon-asks-for-200-b/56-789820",
    "lang": "en",
